{"data":{"body":"[P2] Clear this callback ID when a checkpoint response has already delivered its terminal state. If a callback completes while its submitter is running, a later checkpoint in that invocation can return the completion and advance `handler_seen_seq`, but this ID remains queued for the next invocation. The core deduplication guard then resets, causing `on_operation_end` to fire again and potentially export a duplicate execution-view span. Prune delivered callback IDs for success, failure, and timeout, and add a submitter-completion followed by wait/resume regression.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM77JfsA","finding_digest":"1aa5340fe64be9c4019c933bf095726bbbc34a5b61625818525ad16894077f3a","finding_id":"arf_v1_dkstid7gjpu4iam4sm57bflsno","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-testing/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_testing/execution.py::callback-completion::already-observed-update-redelivery","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-testing/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_testing/execution.py::callback-completion::already-observed-update-redelivery","line":650,"observation_digest":"9000796d6129edde06e7327dee74eb0602ae0de94dac325a8371168b57c3283d","observation_id":"aro_v1_saahs3lbfhw54bxhgj6645hlay","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-testing/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_testing/execution.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_dkstid7gjpu4iam4sm57bflsno","published_at":"2026-10-08T01:00:51Z","review_id":"arr_v1_5xpkmvov6esv4qyovbz6cdi7hd","reviewed_base_sha":"ef683592fbd3edb48c20b880d859c294bc0ae7a0","reviewed_head_sha":"12e760cf72dc14055ae0dec48bf0a20ad73451b2","reviewer":"codex","start_line":650,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":758},"record_id":"art_v1_h6m32hbvik4i4ub6pmhackolm4","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T01:00:51Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
